      "en": "I had heard of you by the hearing of the ear, but now my eye sees you.",
      "ko": "내가 주께 대하여 귀로 듣기만 하였삽더니 이제는 눈으로 주를 뵈옵나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "cc701cab9ea58155835865b2599cb1772f534527d44558e7bb4e292ebacaf29e",
      "translation_text_hash": "7e4734153721e826d308810665c165d35b7ee7b0b7d78f91ffbbbe1732599e58",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
