      "en": "Therefore I abhor myself, and repent in dust and ashes.”",
      "ko": "그러므로 내가 스스로 한하고 티끌과 재 가운데서 회개하나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c11fa6672cc35f4d34d505ce3577861457adb084081bc5980ea20d539e775926",
      "translation_text_hash": "afaa9f7d96745b6132cc4342ae7a540249986c0fea20cfbaae96c03f2f12ab62",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
